{"seq":2,"slug":"psychophysical-methods-laws","title":"心理物理学方法与定律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/sensation-perception/psychophysics/psychophysical-methods-laws","wordCount":1471,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"心理物理学方法与定律\">心理物理学方法与定律</h1><p>往一杯咖啡里加第一勺糖，你尝得出明显变甜；往一杯已经很甜的奶茶里加同样一勺，几乎没区别。「让感觉产生可察觉变化所需的刺激量，取决于已有的刺激强度」——这句话听上去像生活常识，韦伯却在 1834 年把它压成了一个精确的比例式。心理物理学的全部魅力，正在于把这类模糊的主观体验变成可写下、可检验的方程。本篇讲清如何测量阈限，以及描述刺激-感觉关系的三条核心定律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>心理物理学的基本量是阈限（threshold）。绝对阈限（absolute threshold）是有 50% 概率被察觉到的最小刺激强度——之所以取 50% 而非「能/不能」的硬门槛，是因为同一刺激在不同试次里时而被察觉时而错过，察觉概率随强度平滑上升，呈一条 S 形心理测量函数。差别阈限（difference threshold，又称最小可觉差 JND）是能被察觉到的两刺激间最小差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[心理物理学测量] --&gt; B[阈限]&#10;    A --&gt; C[刺激-感觉函数]&#10;    B --&gt; D[绝对阈限&lt;br/&gt;50%察觉的最小强度]&#10;    B --&gt; E[差别阈限 JND&lt;br/&gt;可察觉的最小差异]&#10;    C --&gt; F[韦伯定律&lt;br/&gt;JND与强度成正比]&#10;    C --&gt; G[费希纳定律&lt;br/&gt;感觉∝对数刺激]&#10;    C --&gt; H[斯蒂文斯定律&lt;br/&gt;感觉∝刺激的幂]&#10;    E -.推导.-&gt; F&#10;    F -.积分.-&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n    A[心理物理学测量] --&gt; B[阈限]\n    A --&gt; C[刺激-感觉函数]\n    B --&gt; D[绝对阈限&lt;br/&gt;50%察觉的最小强度]\n    B --&gt; E[差别阈限 JND&lt;br/&gt;可察觉的最小差异]\n    C --&gt; F[韦伯定律&lt;br/&gt;JND与强度成正比]\n    C --&gt; G[费希纳定律&lt;br/&gt;感觉∝对数刺激]\n    C --&gt; H[斯蒂文斯定律&lt;br/&gt;感觉∝刺激的幂]\n    E -.推导.-&gt; F\n    F -.积分.-&gt; G</pre><p>下表列出测量阈限的三种经典范式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>极限法 method of limits</td>\n<td>刺激按升/降序逐步呈现，记录转折点</td>\n<td>快速直观</td>\n<td>易受习惯误差与期待误差影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恒定刺激法 method of constant stimuli</td>\n<td>多个固定强度随机呈现多次</td>\n<td>精确、抗顺序偏差</td>\n<td>试次多、耗时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调整法 method of adjustment</td>\n<td>被试自己连续调节刺激至刚好察觉</td>\n<td>被试参与、最快</td>\n<td>主观、变异大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"韦伯定律-差别阈限与背景成正比\">韦伯定律：差别阈限与背景成正比</h2><p>韦伯发现，差别阈限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 并非常数，而与原刺激强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 成正比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mi>I</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\Delta I}{I} = k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是韦伯分数，对某种感觉维度近似恒定。重量的韦伯分数约 0.02（即基准重量变化约 2% 才可察觉），亮度约 0.08，音强约 0.05。这就量化了开篇的咖啡-奶茶现象：背景越强，需要越大的绝对变化才能被察觉。韦伯定律在中等强度范围拟合极好，但在接近绝对阈限的极弱刺激处会失准。它也解释了为何商品定价、音量旋钮、屏幕亮度调节都倾向于做成「按比例」而非「按绝对量」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"费希纳定律-把-jnd-累加成感觉量表\">费希纳定律：把 JND 累加成感觉量表</h2><p>费希纳的洞见是：如果每个 JND 都代表「一个等量的主观感觉增量」，那么把无数个 JND 沿强度轴累加（数学上即对韦伯定律积分），就能得到感觉强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 与刺激强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = k \\log\\frac{I}{I_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是绝对阈限。这条对数定律意味着：刺激按几何级数增长，感觉才按算术级数增长。声音的分贝标度、星等的亮度标度都内含这种对数压缩——它让感觉系统能在跨越上百万倍的物理强度范围里都保持有用的分辨力。费希纳定律是历史上第一个把心灵量化的方程，意义重大，但它建立在「所有 JND 主观相等」这一未经直接验证的假设上，这正是斯蒂文斯要挑战的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"斯蒂文斯幂定律-用直接估计修正对数\">斯蒂文斯幂定律：用直接估计修正对数</h2><p>斯蒂文斯在二十世纪中叶改用「量值估计法」：直接让被试给感觉强度打分（比如「这个亮度是刚才那个的几倍」），而不绕道 JND。结果发现，许多感觉更符合幂函数而非对数函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>I</mi><mi>a</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = k I^{a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 因感觉维度而异，且揭示了系统的「放大策略」。亮度的指数约 0.33（强压缩，物理强度涨很多感觉才涨一点），响度约 0.6，而电击痛觉的指数高达约 3.5（扩张——物理强度稍涨，痛感剧增，这显然有保护意义）。下表对比两条定律的适用倾向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>感觉维度</th>\n<th>斯蒂文斯指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>亮度</td>\n<td>≈0.33</td>\n<td>压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响度</td>\n<td>≈0.6</td>\n<td>压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线段长度</td>\n<td>≈1.0</td>\n<td>近线性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电击痛</td>\n<td>≈3.5</td>\n<td>扩张</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>幂定律在很宽的强度范围内比对数定律拟合更好，已成为现代心理物理学的主流描述。但它仍把「察觉」当成纯感觉问题，忽略了被试的判断倾向——而那恰恰是<a href=\"signal-detection-theory\">信号检测论</a>要解决的盲点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈限观念的局限\">阈限观念的局限</h2><p>上述全部方法都默认存在一个「阈限」：刺激跨过它就被察觉，跨不过就不被察觉。但被试在临界强度附近的「说有/说没有」，究竟反映了感官灵敏度，还是反映了他「宁可虚报还是宁可漏报」的态度？传统方法无法分离这两者。把感官敏感性与判断标准彻底拆开，是下一篇的核心革命。关于感觉与知觉的基础区分见<a href=\"intro-and-core-concepts\">感觉与知觉导论</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>绝对阈限是 50% 概率被察觉的最小刺激；差别阈限（JND）是可察觉的最小差异；二者用极限法、恒定刺激法、调整法测量。</li>\n<li>韦伯定律：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta I / I = k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，差别阈限与背景强度成正比，量化了「越强越难察觉差异」。</li>\n<li>费希纳定律：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = k\\log(I/I_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，由韦伯定律积分而来，给出感觉的对数压缩，是首个量化心灵的方程。</li>\n<li>斯蒂文斯幂定律：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>I</mi><mi>a</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = kI^a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用直接估计修正对数模型，指数揭示各感觉的压缩或扩张策略，拟合更广。</li>\n<li>所有阈限方法都混淆了敏感性与判断标准，这一根本缺陷由信号检测论破解。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"心理物理学方法与定律","id":"心理物理学方法与定律"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"韦伯定律：差别阈限与背景成正比","id":"韦伯定律-差别阈限与背景成正比"},{"level":2,"text":"费希纳定律：把 JND 累加成感觉量表","id":"费希纳定律-把-jnd-累加成感觉量表"},{"level":2,"text":"斯蒂文斯幂定律：用直接估计修正对数","id":"斯蒂文斯幂定律-用直接估计修正对数"},{"level":2,"text":"阈限观念的局限","id":"阈限观念的局限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"感觉与知觉导论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/sensation-perception/psychophysics/intro-and-core-concepts"},"next":{"title":"信号检测论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/sensation-perception/psychophysics/signal-detection-theory"}}